Provenance
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The encoder, the decoder and the Ogg layer are original implementations
written from the Vorbis I specification (Xiph.Org Foundation) and RFC 3533
(The Ogg Encapsulation Format Version 0). They are not translations of, and
do not derive from, any other Vorbis or Ogg implementation's source. The
specification's one static table, floor1_inverse_dB_table (section 10.1), is
reproduced from the specification as data; docs/PROVENANCE.md records it and
every other source.

The Xiph.Org Vorbis test vectors used by the test suite are not part of this
distribution; tools/fetch-vectors.sh downloads them and tests/vectors/
SHA256SUMS identifies them.

